{
  "spoken_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_hello",
      "string_id": "16980408628996069129",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "V. You came. I was expecting a polite refusal and a malware scan.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_hello.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5200,
      "beat": "opening"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_hello",
      "string_id": "15175627852896059917",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Already ran the scan. You're still pending.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_hello_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "beat": "opening",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_hello_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_job",
      "string_id": "3897210614595280370",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Somebody stole Heartbreaker Protocol. I built it to break emotional-conditioning loops. The Claws turned it into a weapon. Now they're selling it.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_job.wem",
      "duration_ms": 9120,
      "beat": "opening"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_hack",
      "string_id": "2827355708979248330",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Heartbreaker. That supposed to make me feel better?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_hack_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "beat": "what",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_hack_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_hack",
      "string_id": "14981997704910797886",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "The original interrupts conditioning signals. Gives people a window to say no. Theirs keeps the signal screaming until the nervous system folds.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_hack.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "beat": "what"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_recover",
      "string_id": "12750871977998759661",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Why not wipe their server?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_recover_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1680,
      "beat": "recover",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_recover_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_recover",
      "string_id": "15538076547907395033",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Their build has the only live signing key. Burn it and I can't revoke the copies. Recover first. Patch second. Dramatic explosions a distant third.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_recover.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10320,
      "beat": "recover"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_name",
      "string_id": "13541029791074301620",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "You always flirt in your bug reports?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_name_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "beat": "flirt",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_name_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_name",
      "string_id": "10364372180465013600",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Only the critical ones. Low-priority tickets get a tasteful wink.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_name.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "beat": "flirt"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_accept",
      "string_id": "1619376887455519035",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "I'll get your code. Send me the route.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_accept_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3120,
      "beat": "accept",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_accept_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_route",
      "string_id": "18019278892928713928",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Three Claws, two access points. Recover my code and its signing key from the first. Then use the second to shut down the stolen copies. Keep both boxes intact.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_route.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10960,
      "beat": "accept"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_bows",
      "string_id": "3543934580879065958",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "And if you see little black bows in the interface, those are mine. Extremely important diagnostic equipment.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_bows.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6640,
      "beat": "accept"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_later",
      "string_id": "10858545669338369451",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Got something else to finish. Keep the location.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_later_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3520,
      "beat": "later",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_later_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_later",
      "string_id": "8857389735383609999",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I'll be here. Pretending this is a normal amount of anxiety.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_later.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "beat": "later"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_arrive",
      "string_id": "16139508725363668641",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "That's the operation. Recovery point first. Keep it intact; I need the code, not a smoking case.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_arrive.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8560,
      "beat": "approach"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_v_ledger",
      "string_id": "9557674294730147421",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Sales ledger. They're charging extra for a longer feedback loop.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_ledger_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "beat": "evidence",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_ledger_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_ledger",
      "string_id": "9914711321515010935",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Of course they are. Turn off the safety and call it a subscription.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_ledger.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "beat": "evidence"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_v_archive",
      "string_id": "7550691409743714602",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Your archive says conditioning interrupt. Patient keeps emotional autonomy. That wasn't in the sales pitch.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_archive_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "beat": "archive",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_archive_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_archive",
      "string_id": "6115249606000592236",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "No. Read the revoke instructions. We'll talk about the rest when you're clear.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_archive.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "beat": "archive"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_recovery",
      "string_id": "4336984750713796585",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Copy the prototype and its signing key. That key lets us shut down the stolen copies.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_recovery.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "beat": "recover"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_v_copy",
      "string_id": "10765950938436872729",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Copy's clean. Got the key.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_copy_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "beat": "recovered",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_copy_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_patch",
      "string_id": "276855759636062308",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Good. Upload my fix at the second access point. It'll shut down the stolen copies and give the guards a few seconds of optical trouble.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_patch.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "beat": "upload"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_v_brand",
      "string_id": "17004599629921782473",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Upload says Velvet Crash.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_brand_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2240,
      "beat": "upload",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_brand_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_brand",
      "string_id": "1979828368096402787",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Fits in the menu. Very professional.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_brand.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2880,
      "beat": "upload"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_success",
      "string_id": "4990069799116463401",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Fix accepted. Stolen copies shut down. Oh, look. Hearts. And the bows survived compilation.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_success.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8000,
      "beat": "success"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_v_success",
      "string_id": "10292433490235235167",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Their optics didn't.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_success_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1840,
      "beat": "success",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_v_success_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_exit",
      "string_id": "6785582190925036662",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "The guards' optics will recover. The people they sold this to get their emotions back. Now get clear.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_exit.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "beat": "exit"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_02_velvet_retry",
      "string_id": "4710777629599113492",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Link dropped. Nothing committed. Reconnect when you're ready.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_02_velvet_retry.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "beat": "interrupted"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_return",
      "string_id": "9326198706302979747",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "There you are. Code intact. Distribution keys dead. I almost sent a normal thank-you.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_return.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "beat": "opening"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_v_question",
      "string_id": "14076458176472055141",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "The archive. You built it for someone.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_question_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "beat": "opening",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_question_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_friend",
      "string_id": "11261539277534521313",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "A friend. Her partner paid for a mood regulator. Called it helping. Every time she got angry, it made being agreeable feel better.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_friend.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8800,
      "beat": "opening"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_cost",
      "string_id": "3851357283064953564",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "She knew something was wrong. Just couldn't hold on to the feeling long enough to leave.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_cost.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4800,
      "beat": "opening"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_truth",
      "string_id": "209976722909800386",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I wanted to give her that feeling back. Not put another one in its place.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_truth.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "beat": "opening"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_v_sincere",
      "string_id": "3447555177663139336",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "You gave her a way to choose. That matters.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_sincere_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "beat": "sincere",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_sincere_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_sincere",
      "string_id": "581051657885304764",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "She did the leaving. I just broke a lock. Still... thanks for knowing the difference.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_sincere.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "beat": "sincere"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_v_tease",
      "string_id": "12210822694412636017",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Could've called it Consent Patch. Went with hearts and weaponized ribbons.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_tease_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4000,
      "beat": "tease",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_tease_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_tease",
      "string_id": "13302109527002221941",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "People remember hearts. And the ribbons are black. There are standards.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_tease.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "beat": "tease"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_v_tease_soft",
      "string_id": "10132533625446414382",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Your standards did some good today.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_tease_soft_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2160,
      "beat": "tease",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_tease_soft_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_v_friend",
      "string_id": "8498838853296619757",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Your friend okay?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_friend_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "beat": "friend",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_friend_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_friend_now",
      "string_id": "6996642977783215546",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "She's out. We talk when she wants. Sometimes she doesn't. That's sort of the point.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_friend_now.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "beat": "friend"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_reward",
      "string_id": "10085675471022865382",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Your own build. Heartbreaker Protocol. Velvet Crash on the quickhack menu. No conditioning payload. Just a short combat-system interruption and terrible taste.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_reward.wem",
      "duration_ms": 11040,
      "beat": "reward"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_v_reward",
      "string_id": "14332000867347249306",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Guess I can live with the bows.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_reward_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2480,
      "beat": "reward",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_v_reward_m.wem"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_03_velvet_close",
      "string_id": "1077986469800269399",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Don't sound so brave. They suit you.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_03_velvet_close.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "beat": "reward"
    }
  ],
  "choice_lines": []
}
